    "closed": [
      "All report reads use current internal adult/auth scope. Numeric query projection shares filtering, reads only visible transfer legs, avoids note/payee body hydration unless search and rechecks SQL authority/revisions. Private dimensions stay redacted.",
      "Balance reads opening amounts and ledger, including trades; category/query/split metadata cannot distort it. Default excludedStats accounts are omitted; explicit account selection can inspect them. Credit limit is not wealth.",
      "Exact BigInt signed64 totals, one parent FX conversion with deterministic largest-remainder split allocation, unique label grand totals and explicit overlap. Zero or incomplete prior comparisons return null ratios. Supported calendar limits retain unavailable-previous semantics.",
      "Drilldowns preserve exact/null group membership. Optional categoryMatch exact is separate from existing default descendant filtering; unassigned/unlabeled flags have strict shared normalization and visible filter controls. Aggregate SDK cohort may not broaden accounts.",
      "Explicit schema8/standalone9 adds immutable daily public USD/VND cache only. Accepted1-7 SQL bytes remain; no automatic activation or migration. Old fixture contracts remain explicitly pinned. Snapshot validation covers exact ratio, pair/source/chronology.",
      "Public provider IO is bounded fixed HTTPS and outside I01; tests use synthetic providers. Refresh rechecks Admin after await and inside writer; same-key cached receipt is returned before fetching. Native audit failure rolls back quote/audit/nonce, while an actual nonempty historical record FX row remains identical.",
      "Strict read-only SDK and session-owned Analytics retire results immediately on SSE/refresh/hide/logout and ignore late generations. Unknown refresh retains exact date/body/key across navigation and explicit retry; current capability loss blocks commands.",
      "Four metrics, five group dimensions, bounded buckets/points, three SVG chart kinds, accessible exact-value table, pagination, vi/en/zh and theme patterns. Empty/error/incomplete are distinct; actual quote source dates and seven-day carry are exposed."
    ],
